<!--
  Author: Kris Hollingsworth
  Class: Math122-Calculus 2
  Date: 7/23/26
  File: E02-C24-04-methods-for-trig-three.oml
  Description:
    Finding useful identities from sum of angle identities.
  Raw Link: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DoctorHaitch/doenet-math-problems/main/M122-Calculus-2/E02-C24-04-methods-for-trig-three.oml
-->
<setup>
  <m name="sine_sum_diff">\sin A \cos B \pm \cos A \sin B</m>
  <m name="cosine_sum_diff">\cos A \cos B \mp \sin A \sin B</m>
</setup>
<section boxed>
  <title>Warning!</title>
  This activity is currently broken until minus-plus, <m>\mp</m>, is parsed correctly
  by the back-end MathParser library.
</section>
<cascade revealAll>
  <div>
    <p>
      Recall the sum and different identities:
      <ul>
        <li>
          <mathInput
            name="sine_sum_diff_input"
          >
            <!-- prefillLatex="\sin A \cos B \pm \cos A \sin B" -->
            <label><m>\sin(A\pm B)=</m></label>
          </mathInput>
          <text hide="not($answer_one.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>
        </li>
        <li>
          <mathInput
            name="cosine_sum_diff_input"
          >
            <!-- prefillLatex="\cos A \cos B \mp \sin A \sin B" -->
            <label><m>\cos(A\pm B)=</m></label>
          </mathInput>
          <text hide="not($answer_one.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <answer
      name="answer_one"
      numAwardsCredited="2"
      hide="$answer_one.creditAchieved=1"
    >
      <!-- %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
      %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
            FIX ONCE \mp WORKS!
      %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
      %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% -->
      <award credit="1"> 
        <when>$sine_sum_diff = $sine_sum_diff_input</when>
      </award>
      <award credit=".5">
        <when>$cosine_sum_diff = $cosine_sum_diff_input</when>
      </award>
    </answer>
  </div>
  
  <div>
    <p>
      Then
      <me>
        \begin{align*}
          \sin(A+B) & = \sin A\cos B + \cos A \sin B \\
          \sin(A-B) & = \sin A\cos B - \cos A \sin B \\ 
        \end{align*}
      </me>
      Adding these equations together, we obtain

      <text hide="not($answer_two.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>
      <choiceInput name="choice_one" shuffleOrder inline>
        <choice name="correct_one"><m>\sin(A+B)+\sin(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\sin(A+B)-\sin(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\sin(A-B)-\sin(A+B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\cos(A+B)-\cos(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\cos(A-B)-\cos(A+B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\cos(A+B)+\cos(A-B)</m></choice>
      </choiceInput> = <choiceInput name="choice_two" shuffleOrder inline>
        <choice name="correct_two"><m>2\sin A \cos B</m></choice>
        <choice><m>2\cos A \sin B</m></choice>
        <choice><m>2\cos A \cos B</m></choice>
        <choice><m>-2\sin A \sin B</m></choice>
      </choiceInput><text hide="not($answer_two.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <answer name="answer_two" numAwardsCredited="2">
        <award credit="1/2"><when>$correct_one.selected</when></award>
        <award credit="1/2"><when>$correct_two.selected</when></award>
      </answer>
    </p>
  </div>
  
  <div>
    <p>
      Also
      <me>
        \begin{align*} \cos(A+B) & = \cos A \cos B - \sin A \sin B \\ \cos(A-B)
        & = \cos A \cos B + \sin A \sin B \\ \end{align*}
      </me>
      Adding these equations together, we obtain
      
      <text hide="not($answer_three.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>
      <choiceInput name="choice_three" shuffleOrder inline>
        <choice><m>\sin(A+B)+\sin(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\sin(A+B)-\sin(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\sin(A-B)-\sin(A+B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\cos(A+B)-\cos(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\cos(A-B)-\cos(A+B)</m></choice>
        <choice name="correct_three"><m>\cos(A+B)+\cos(A-B)</m></choice>
      </choiceInput> = <choiceInput name="choice_four" shuffleOrder inline>
        <choice><m>2\sin A \cos B</m></choice>
        <choice><m>2\cos A \sin B</m></choice>
        <choice name="correct_four"><m>2\cos A \cos B</m></choice>
        <choice><m>-2\sin A \sin B</m></choice>
      </choiceInput><text hide="not($answer_three.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>.
      Additionally, in this case we subtract these equations as well to obtain

      <text hide="not($answer_three.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>
      <choiceInput name="choice_five" shuffleOrder inline>
        <choice><m>\sin(A+B)+\sin(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\sin(A+B)-\sin(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\sin(A-B)-\sin(A+B)</m></choice>
        <choice  name="correct_five"><m>\cos(A+B)-\cos(A-B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\cos(A-B)-\cos(A+B)</m></choice>
        <choice><m>\cos(A+B)+\cos(A-B)</m></choice>
      </choiceInput> = <choiceInput name="choice_six" shuffleOrder inline>
        <choice><m>2\sin A \cos B</m></choice>
        <choice><m>2\cos A \sin B</m></choice>
        <choice><m>2\cos A \cos B</m></choice>
        <choice name="correct_six"><m>-2\sin A \sin B</m></choice>
      </choiceInput><text hide="not($answer_three.creditAchieved=1)">✅</text>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <answer name="answer_three" numAwardsCredited="4">
        <award credit="1/4"><when>$correct_three.selected</when></award>
        <award credit="1/4"><when>$correct_four.selected</when></award>
        <award credit="1/4"><when>$correct_five.selected</when></award>
        <award credit="1/4"><when>$correct_six.selected</when></award>
      </answer>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p>
      By re-arranging the three equalities you found above, we obtain the following useful identities for simplifying integration
      <me>
        \begin{align*}
          \sin(A)\cos(B) & = \textstyle\frac{1}{2}\left[\sin(A-B)+\sin(A+B)\right] \tag{1} \\[.5em]
          \sin(A)\sin(B) & = \textstyle\frac{1}{2}\left[\cos(A-B)-\cos(A+B)\right] \tag{2} \\[.5em]
        \cos(A)\cos(B) & = \textstyle\frac{1}{2}\left[\cos(A-B)+\cos(A+B)\right] \tag{3} \\[.5em]
        \end{align*}
      </me>
    </p>
  </div>
</cascade>